<title>USA: Nabors to buy two Samson units for $85 mln.</title>
<headline>Nabors to buy two Samson units for $85 mln.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nabors Industries Inc said Monday it has executed a definitive agreement to acquire Samson Rig Co and Rig Properties Inc from a subsidiary of Samson Investment Co for $85 million in cash.</p>
<p>It said the deal is expected to close in May.</p>
</text>
